      "title": "smb: add some necessary CHECK_BYTE_COUNT_SUBR() calls.",
      "message": "smb: add some necessary CHECK_BYTE_COUNT_SUBR() calls.\n\nAdd CHECK_BYTE_COUNT_SUBR() calls before advancing the offset and byte\ncount; it was missing in some cases.\n\nReplace one manually-done equivalent of COUNT_BYTES_SUBR(2) with a call\nto the macro.\n\nRemove a redundant subtraction from the byte count - it was already done\nby a preceding COUNT_BYTES_SUBR() call.\n\nWhile we're at it, fix some instances of FALSE, replacing them with the\nbool constant false.\n",
      "author_name": "Guy Harris",
      "author_email": "gharris@sonic.net",
